OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786105098
OL,3,CAdoption system in 'crisis' as
OL,4,Cshortage leaves children waiting
OL,5,Clonger in care
OL,7,FAdoption is changing - are the words
OL,8,Fof one social worker who works
OL,9,Ftirelessly to match children with
OL,10,Fadoptive families.
OL,12,FThe 4th of August 2026 marks 100 years
OL,13,Fsince adoption was legalised in
OL,14,FEngland and Wales. Today, experts
OL,15,Fworking within the sector, say the
OL,16,Fsystem is under "increasing pressure".
OL,18,FJulia Neilson, who is an experienced
OL,19,Fsocial worker with Western Bay
OL,20,FAdoption Service in South Wales, said:
OL,21,F"Adoption is changing."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
