OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786105098
OL,3,CAdoption system in 'crisis' as
OL,4,Cshortage leaves children waiting
OL,5,Clonger in care
OL,7,F"Children that come to us now have
OL,8,Foften experienced early trauma and
OL,9,Fthat impacts on their development and
OL,10,Fthe kind of parenting that they need.
OL,12,F'We are absolutely stretched, we are
OL,13,Fdealing with crisis every day'
OL,15,FCoram is the UK's longest and oldest
OL,16,Fserving children's charity established
OL,17,Fin 1739.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786105098
OL,3,CAdoption system in 'crisis' as
OL,4,Cshortage leaves children waiting
OL,5,Clonger in care
OL,7,FThe charity collects data on behalf of
OL,8,Fthe Department for Education and
OL,9,Festimates that by the end of 2025
OL,10,Fthere were more than 3,000 children
OL,11,Fwaiting to be adopted but less than
OL,12,F1,500 approved families.
OL,14,FTen years ago, it was the other way
OL,15,Fround, with more families than
OL,16,Fchildren.
OL,18,FDame Carol Homden, Chief Executive of
OL,19,FCoram, explains why there is a
OL,20,Fshortage of people coming forward to
OL,21,Fadopt.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786105098
OL,3,CAdoption system in 'crisis' as
OL,4,Cshortage leaves children waiting
OL,5,Clonger in care
OL,7,F"I think it's because of demographic
OL,8,Fchanges, so the age profile of the
OL,9,Fpopulation. Also, we have a cost of
OL,10,Fliving crisis, housing costs in
OL,11,Fparticular are very high for some
OL,12,Ffamilies.
OL,14,F"But we are also in a time where
OL,15,Fscience has made great advances in
OL,16,Ffertility treatment, so some people
OL,17,Fwho might have considered adoption
OL,18,Fearlier are taking the opportunity.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786105098
OL,3,CAdoption system in 'crisis' as
OL,4,Cshortage leaves children waiting
OL,5,Clonger in care
OL,7,F"So the combination of all of these
OL,8,Fthings, plus the continued number of
OL,9,Fchildren entering the care system
OL,10,Fmeans we have reached the point where
OL,11,Fwe do not have enough adopters for the
OL,12,Fchildren who are waiting," said Dame
OL,13,FCarol.
OL,15,FThe Department for Education said it
OL,16,Fis working to "improve" support for
OL,17,Fboth adopted children and their
OL,18,Ffamilies.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786105098
OL,3,CAdoption system in 'crisis' as
OL,4,Cshortage leaves children waiting
OL,5,Clonger in care
OL,7,FA Government spokesperson said: "We
OL,8,Fconsulted on how adoption support
OL,9,Fservices could be improved earlier
OL,10,Fthis year and will set out our full
OL,11,Fplans in response shortly.
OL,13,F"In the meantime we have increased the
OL,14,Ffunding we make available for
OL,15,Fspecialist therapies where children
OL,16,Fmight have experienced trauma or abuse
OL,17,Fthrough the Adoption and Special
OL,18,FGuardianship Support Fund."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786105098
OL,3,CAdoption system in 'crisis' as
OL,4,Cshortage leaves children waiting
OL,5,Clonger in care
OL,7,FIn its centenary year, the adoption
OL,8,Fsystem has evolved, but Dame Carol
OL,9,Fbelieves we are at a critical moment.
OL,11,F"Every child must have consistent and
OL,12,Ffair access to support and there is a
OL,13,Fhuge variation of that access.
OL,15,F"There is a really important moment
OL,16,Fboth governmentally and as a society,
OL,17,Fto invest in our children.
OL,19,F"So we have as responsive a system as
OL,20,Fpossible. How to achieve that is where
OL,21,Fthe challenge lies."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
